  "hints": [
    {
      "level": 1,
      "type": "diagram",
      "content": "因为 (7 ^ 9 ^ 3 ^ 7 ^ 3) = (7 ^ 7) ^ (3 ^ 3) ^ 9 = 0 ^ 0 ^ 9 = 9，只需从头到尾把每个元素依次 xor 进 t2！"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "type": "steps",
      "content": "1. addi t2, zero, 0；2. loop: beq t1, zero, done；3. lw t3, 0(t0)；4. xor t2, t2, t3；5. addi t0, t0, 4；6. addi t1, t1, -1；7. j loop；8. done:。"
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "type": "snippet",
